  "body": "### What is the issue with the Quirks Mode Standard?\n\nhttps://quirks.spec.whatwg.org/#the-percentage-height-calculation-quirk\n\n> In [quirks mode](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-quirks), for the purpose of calculating the [height](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-3/#propdef-height) of an element element,\n\nThis links to the `height` property, but I understand it loosely includes `min-height` and `max-height`. All browsers agree:\n\n```html\n<div style=\"height: 50px; width: 50px\">\n  <div style=\"background: red\">\n    <div style=\"height: 0%; min-height: 100%; background: green\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n| Firefox, Chrome, WebKit |\n| - |\n| <img width=\"57\" height=\"59\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78b7f57a-0552-49ae-998e-b40015847727\" /> |\n\nHowever,\n\n> the specified value for the [`height`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-3/#propdef-height) property of element is a [`<percentage>`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-4/#percentage-value)\n\nWhat happens if `height` is not set to a percentage, but `min/max-height` are?\n\nOn replaced elements, browsers agree to require a percentage in `height` in order to also affect the percentage in `min/max-height`:\n\n```html\n<div style=\"height: 50px; width: 50px; background: green\">\n  <div>\n    <canvas style=\"height: 0px; min-height: 100%; width: 100%; background: red\"></canvas>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n| Firefox, Chrome, WebKit |\n| - |\n| <img width=\"57\" height=\"59\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78b7f57a-0552-49ae-998e-b40015847727\" /> |\n\nBut they disagree on non-replaced elements, then Chrome and WebKit drop the requirement:\n\n```html\n<div style=\"height: 50px; width: 50px; background: green\">\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"height: 0px; min-height: 100%; background: red\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n| Firefox | Chrome, WebKit |\n| - | - |\n| <img width=\"57\" height=\"59\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78b7f57a-0552-49ae-998e-b40015847727\" /> | <img width=\"57\" height=\"59\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/659b757f-352b-4fe9-a3da-24ade178624f\" />  \n\n",
